%N A401230 Numbers of the form p^2*q where p and q are primes with p > q, and p divides A276085(p^2*q), and A003415(p^2*q) divides A276085(p^2*q), where A276085 is fully additive with a(p) = p#/p, and A003415 is the arithmetic derivative.
